<title>USA: BW/IP acquires remaining Byron Jackson stake.</title>
<headline>BW/IP acquires remaining Byron Jackson stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, Calif. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BW/IP Inc on Tuesday said it has acquired the 49 percent minority interest in its joint venture in Argentina, Byron Jackson Argentina I.C.S.A.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Byron Jackson produces centrifugal pumps and provides aftermarket parts and services for the petroleum and power industries in Latin America. Sales in 1996 were $15 million. BW/IP has manufactured pumps in Argentina since 1964.</p>
</text>
